// anchors: ref.diag.DL0210
// P17-F5: expression nesting is capped at 128 levels. Before the cap, deep nesting did not
// produce a diagnostic at all — it overflowed the stack and killed the process (exit 127).
// 200 levels is used rather than the 100,000 that crashed, so this file stays small; the
// full-size witness lives in delulu-syntax's parser tests.
